		(property "Note" "Reflow the 74 SMD contacts, then solder the four 2.2 mm through-hole shell tails. Mating face nominally 0.20 mm behind the board edge - see the SLIMSAS comment block for the one dimension no document gave and check it before cutting the panel window. Insertion force 55.5 N max, 250 mating cycles min."
			(at 853.44 262.89 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
		(property "Description" "SlimSAS SFF-8654 8i, 74 position, right angle. 16 differential pairs plus 16 sideband contacts. Row A is driven by this board, row B is received; the cable crosses A(n) to B(n), which is what lets ONE design sit at both ends"
			(at 853.44 262.89 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
