		(property "Note" "EN = DRV_EN, EN* = GND. DRV_EN is SB_PRSNT_IN through the FITTED link R_DRVEN_PRSNT, so the drivers run only while a powered, configured far end asserts presence: a radio on with the Tang off pushes no LVDS current into the dead Gowin. REQUIRES the sideband cable (CAB-8654/8654-8i-P); the no-sideband variant leaves the link dead. R_DRVEN_ON (not fitted) forces them on for bench tests."
			(at 364.49 356.87 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
		(property "Description" "Quad LVDS driver, 400 Mbps, SOIC-16. THE FORWARD GROUP: 153.6 MHz forward clock plus ADC data lanes 0, 1 and 2 at 307.2 Mbit/s each. Three lanes DDR at 153.6 MHz is 921.6 Mbit/s, the complete raw 12-bit 76.8 MSPS stream. All four channels used, none spare"
			(at 364.49 356.87 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
