		(property "Description" "Quad LVDS receiver, 400 Mbps, TSSOP-16. Channel 1 receives the far end's DUPLICATE forward clock, which is what makes the duplicate symmetric: fit R_CLKSEL_B instead of R_CLKSEL_A and FPGA pin 88 is fed from this channel instead. Channels 2 and 3 are the auxiliary receive pair, channel 4 a spare whose output is left unconnected"
