		(property "LCSC" "C25104"
			(at 763.27 346.71 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
		(property "Description" "AUXIO line 0 series resistor, DB1-10 = FPGA pin 90. Limits contention to 7.4 mA worst case if the radio drives this pin while the DRIVE path is enabled. CW/PTT ring. 2.2k pull-up to +3V3 (R75), 100R to the KEY jack (R77) and 1 uF to ground (C71) on the radio, so its own time constant is 2.2 ms - a DC/slow input, not a signalling pin"
			(at 763.27 346.71 0)
