		(property "Note" "Port 1: DIR = +3V3 (A->B), OE* = JTAG_EN_N; channel 2 input grounded. Port 2: DIR = +3V3 (A->B), OE* = GND; channel 1 DI_FWDCLK -> LA_CLK, channel 2 input grounded, output unconnected. Adds one CMOS input to the forward clock net, as U5 does, so keep the stub short: within 5 mm of U1."
			(at 636.27 419.1 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
		(property "Description" "JTAG buffer part 2, and the clock buffer of the link-alive detector. Port 1 channel 1 is TDI from the cable into CN1, gated by JTAG_EN_N. Port 2 channel 1 buffers a copy of the translated forward clock DI_FWDCLK into the detector pump, always on, so the detector loads neither FPGA pin 98 nor its divider. PLACE BESIDE U1"
			(at 636.27 419.1 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
