		(property "Note" "Output tolerance +/-2%, so VCCA worst case 2.55 V and the translator VIH worst case 0.65 x 2.55 = 1.66 V against the HL2's guaranteed 2.0 V VOH: 340 mV of margin. Enable is tied to the input. If you would rather the thresholds tracked the FPGA's own bank supply exactly, fit SL_VLVDS and FB2 and remove U12 - but read the note on SL_VLVDS first."
			(at 728.98 406.4 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
		(property "Description" "2.5 V 400 mA LDO, the 2.5 V side of U1, U2 and U3 only. Computed load 50 mA, so 8x of headroom and 40 mW of dissipation"
