			(at 711.2 468.63 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
		(property "Description" "JTAG_FORCE: fit to enable JTAG over the cable WITHOUT working HL2 gateware, which is the case you most want it in. On the buffer side of the link-alive gate Q3, because a radio with no link gateware makes no forward clock. 1 k beats the 10 k pull-up (0.30 V); U2 cannot fight it because Q3 is off whenever its source is HIGH"
